BOSULIF can harm your unborn baby. Females who are able to become pregnant should have a pregnancy test before starting treatment with BOSULIF.
It is not known if BOSULIF passes into your breast milk or if it can harm your baby. Do not breastfeed during treatment with BOSULIF and for at least 2 weeks after the last dose.
