We first summarize the main causes of PCB open circuit into the following aspects (fishbone diagram analysis)
There are scratches before the copper clad laminate is put into the warehouse;
The copper foil on the surface was bumped due to improper operation when stacking the boards after copper sinking;
The copper foil on the surface of the production board is scratched when it passes through the leveling machine;
a. The chuck can be replaced by the number of times recorded by the knife or according to the degree of wear of the chuck;
Clean the chuck regularly according to the operating regulations to ensure that there is no debris in the chuck.
Scratched due to improper operation after copper sinking and full plate electroplating: When storing boards after copper sinking or full plate electroplating, the weight is not light when the plates are stacked together and then put down. , The board angle is downward and there is a gravitational acceleration, forming a strong impact force to hit the board surface, causing the board surface to scratch the exposed substrate.
The production board is scratched when passing through the leveling machine:
The baffle of the plate grinder sometimes touches the surface of the board, and the edge of the baffle is uneven and the object is raised, and the surface of the board is scratched when passing the board;
