Application of wind farm dedicated real-time data gateway in industrial Internet access
Application of wind farm dedicated real-time data gateway in industrial Internet access
Industrial Internet technology wants to play to the advantages of networking, cloud computing and intelligence, it is necessary to complete the data access of production real-time data to the industrial Internet platform.
Therefore, the real-time production data must be forwarded through a three-zone system that meets the network security requirements to achieve data access from the wind farm to the industrial Internet platform. Main demand
Obtain real-time data of the production operation process from a variety of equipment, the most important of which is the real-time operation data of the wind turbine;
The data is forwarded through the first area to the second area, and then from the second area to the third area;
The data acquisition link, the non-standard protocol of the data system used by the wind turbine, and the measurement point information of the wind turbine control system.
However, in the data acquisition link, very trivial details in the field of wind power will be involved, especially the measurement point information. At the same time, due to the private protocol adopted by the wind power master control system, the documents and public information are not complete, and the private protocol connecting with different master control equipment will also consume a lot of trial and error costs.
The dedicated real-time data gateway for wind farms is our solution for this situation. The gateway solves the problem of data acquisition through two aspects of work.
Docking the communication protocol of the mainstream wind power main control system, and at the same time converting the data into standard industrial Internet communication protocols, including mainstream communication protocols such as Modbus-TCP and OPC UA.
