There are many brands and types of waterproof socket in the market, including the traditional waterproof socket used in home life, such as triangle plug, which can be called socket, but generally it is not waterproof. Then how to judge the waterproof socket?
Domestic outdoor waterproof socket, 220v10a three plug and two plug can be used in the non protective state to meet the needs of domestic use. (the protection level IP66 can meet the needs of the family.
Waterproof socket is to add a waterproof box with a cover outside the general embedded wall socket. The place where the box contacts the wall has a rubber mat, so it can be waterproof; some waterproof sockets are plastic rain proof sheath, with the middle cutting hole facing down and supporting special cutting head.
Installation of waterproof socket in toilet The toilet is the most humid place in the home, and the socket is easy to splash water, so the selection and installation of the socket in the toilet must pay special attention to:
When installing the socket in the toilet, install it as high as possible, away from the water nozzle or water outlet device.
The socket in the toilet must be protected by a protective cover, and the switch with plastic protective film shall be selected.
In the use process, make sure that the hand is dry, do not bring water to use the switch and socket.
Strictly control the quality of switches and sockets, and the products purchased by itself are unqualified. Even if people use electricity safely, there are hidden dangers of leakage.
For the convenience of lighting in the home, many people also install sockets outside, such as balcony, courtyard Pavilion and other places. Due to the rain and other reasons outside, more attention should be paid to the selection and use of sockets:
The socket shall be installed in a concealed place where rainwater cannot be poured.
We should choose a large brand waterproof socket with good quality. If the quality of waterproof socket is not good, there will be a great potential safety hazard when it is used in outdoor humid weather.
Try to cut off the outdoor power supply in rainy days to avoid other accidents, and try not to be close to the place with electricity.
The protection level of outdoor plug and socket is relatively high, and it is recommended to select IP55 or above.
