Principle of waterproof socket: How to install waterproof socket
A waterproof socket is not only a plug with waterproof performance, but also provides a safe and reliable connection for electricity and signals. For example: LED street lights, LED drive power, LED display screens, lighthouses, cruise ships, industrial equipment, communication equipment, detection equipment, commercial plazas, highways, villa exterior walls, gardens, parks, etc., all need to use waterproof sockets.
The waterproof socket is a waterproof box with a cover added to the outside of the general wall socket. The box is in contact with the wall with a rubber cushion, so it can be waterproof; some waterproof sockets are made of plastic rainproof jacket, with the inner stub Next, supporting special skewer.
Bathroom waterproof socket installation The bathroom is the wettest place in the home, and the outlet is more prone to splashing water, so you must pay special attention to the selection and installation of the outlet in the bathroom:
When installing the socket of the bathroom, it should be installed as high as possible, away from the spout or water outlet device.
The socket of the bathroom must be protected by a protective cover. Choose a switch with a plastic protective film.
When purchasing the socket, check whether the socket clip is sufficiently tight, the insertion force is sufficient, and the socket clip must be tough. The current socket clip structure mostly adopts the strong extrusion method, so the bite force between the plug and the clip is greatly increased, and the phenomenon of heat generation during long-term use is avoided.
When using, make sure your hands are dry, and do not use switches and sockets with water. 5.
